{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，当 flavor 为 seurat_v3 或 seurat_v3_paper 时，输入应为计数数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "该要求对应的表示约束是原始 UMI 计数，要求数值状态为 fresh 和 integer_like_counts，并禁止 normalized、log1p、scaled、integrated 等变换。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "required_value_states\": [\"fresh\", \"integer_like_counts\"], \"required_transformations\": [], \"forbidden_transformations\": [\"normalized\", \"log1p\", \"scaled\", \"integrated\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态为 raw_integer_counts，形状为 [3000, 12000]，这符合计数数据的要求，因此可以直接作为输入。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    },
    {
      "text": "由于没有提供 counts 层，下一步应直接将该原始整数计数矩阵传入 highly_variable_genes 函数，并设置 flavor='seurat_v3' 和 n_top_genes=2000。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": ""
}
